<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Feb 15--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Feb 15--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---02/15/97  02/08/97     Week</p>
